                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The stroke of a brush, as in painting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed001a1b-c135-4e88-a3cc-888f5c6f8fe6",
                                                "sense_id": "a134b766-588c-3ef3-ac06-b6f1a5588d40",
                                                "text": "Since moving to the city [Paris], his [Vincent Van Gogh’s] palette had become lighter and more colorful and his brushstrokes more distinct. In this painting [Boulevard de Clichy], the pastel colors reflect the soft, wintry light. His brushstrokes, now shorter and almost dash-like, give the pedestrians a sense of hurrying along the boulevard."
                                            }
